     tooltip="When new entries are allowed, written as one session string: hours, then days after the colon. 1 = Sunday … 7 = Saturday, so 23456 is Mon-Fri. Several ranges are allowed, e.g. 0000-0600,1200-1800:23456. This replaces the seven weekday toggles and the twenty-four hourly toggles.")
